{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brace yourself to face the chilling horror of the unknown.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent into the facility will uncover new dangers lingering in the dark, as the further down you go, the less light you\u2019ll find. Gear up and beware of the unexpected that comes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/b2b8c235ecb22cabf45d357c032d9759.poster.avif?t=1771396064\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/b2b8c235ecb22cabf45d357c032d9759.webm?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/b2b8c235ecb22cabf45d357c032d9759.mp4?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use a vast arsenal of weapons  from pistols to grenade launchers in order to survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/8e6bbb1473d08b9fda9567b8862f09e8.poster.avif?t=1771396064\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/8e6bbb1473d08b9fda9567b8862f09e8.webm?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/8e6bbb1473d08b9fda9567b8862f09e8.mp4?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Danger lies in the darkness, and only light can protect you, so make it your friend.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeing what hurts you is the first step to survival. Thus, balance risk and reward and don\u2019t let greed get the best of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/33657224f509a19b386e1e5c1251cff6.poster.avif?t=1771396064\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/33657224f509a19b386e1e5c1251cff6.webm?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/33657224f509a19b386e1e5c1251cff6.mp4?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every corner has something worth discovering.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, the facility hides its resources among the endless dangers. One chest might contain the light you need to survive or a valuable asset to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/49510d6ebeec1099ae7af3aaa94798a9.poster.avif?t=1771396064\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/49510d6ebeec1099ae7af3aaa94798a9.webm?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/49510d6ebeec1099ae7af3aaa94798a9.mp4?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Most importantly, a trusted partner is your best ally.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch each other\u2019s backs against ambushes from the dark. Two flashlights in the darkness will serve you better than one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/cffd8a96ccd68dfd7da336aa1a0455ff.poster.avif?t=1771396064\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/cffd8a96ccd68dfd7da336aa1a0455ff.webm?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/extras/cffd8a96ccd68dfd7da336aa1a0455ff.mp4?t=1771396064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The only way out is extraction. Will you escape the shadow or get lost in it?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705550?t=1771396064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705550?t=1771396064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/9c6ef8bee7fc4b5f4448a0d8f65100105cf35f8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771396064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705550/9c6ef8bee7fc4b5f4448a0d8f65100105cf35f8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771396064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features horror elements, including violence, blood, disturbing creatures, darkness, and jump scares."},"demos":[{"appid":4094920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brace yourself to face the chilling horror of the unknown.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent into the facility will uncover new dangers lingering in the dark, as the fu